app/engines/world_model.py and tests/test_world_model.py are a Python port of the
Meterless World Model reference engine and its conformance checks
(https://github.com/Meterless/Meterless, engines/world-model), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The port changes the language and adds decision
records that depend on facts and are reopened when a fact is superseded; the
module docstring describes what was ported and what was added.

Data: openFDA (https://open.fda.gov) adverse-event and drug-label data, used through
its public API. openFDA data is not validated for clinical use; see the README.
